      "id": "claim_aae6722318a34d27bdb27b2b1ff9725c",
      "statement": "GitHub deliveries use the signed `POST /webhooks/github` ingress: it verifies `X-Hub-Signature-256`, records the event, rejects unsupported event types, and returns 503 on an unavailable workspace-ownership lookup so GitHub retries rather than losing the delivery.",
